#TC-001 Open Group Produk ketika belum ada 'Grup Produk'
User berada pada halaman Dashboard
    Dashboard Pagii Affiliate
User klik tombol menu "Produk"
    Click Element    //a[@href='/products/browse']
    Wait Until Element Is Visible    //a[@href='/products/browse']    2s

User pindah ke navigasi menu "Group Produk"
    Wait Until Element Is Visible    //button[text()='Jelajahi Produk']    2s
    Click Element    //button[text()='Grup Produk']
    Sleep    1s

User berhasil melihat halaman Group Produk kosong
    Wait Until Page Contains Element    //button[text()='Grup Produk']
    Sleep    3s
    ${nameGroupProduk}    Get Text    //h3[@class='mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800']
    Capture Page Screenshot    Embed
    Sleep    1s

#TC-002 Menampilkan Group produk yang sudah terbuat
User sudah di halaman Group Produk
    User Berada Pada Halaman Group Produk
User view Group produk card
    Wait Until Element Is Visible    (//div)[22] 
    Sleep    5s
Sistem menampilkan data setiap card produk dengan detail informasi "Nama card", "deskripsi singkat card", "jumlah product yang ada dalam card", "button share", "button edit", "icon delete"
    ${card_group_produk_name}=    Get Text    (//h3[@class='font-bold text-slate-800 text-xl truncate leading-tight group-hover:text-primary transition-colors mb-1'])[1]
    ${card_group_produk_deskripsi}=    Get Text    (//p[@class='text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed overflow-hidden break-words mb-6'])[1]
    ${card_group_produk_jumlah_product}=    Get Text    (//span[@class='text-[12px] font-medium text-slate-400 italic'])[1]
    Page Should Contain    ${card_group_produk_name}
    Page Should Contain    ${card_group_produk_deskripsi}
    Page Should Contain    ${card_group_produk_jumlah_product}
    Element Should Be Visible    (//button[@class='flex-1 bg-primary text-white font-bold text-sm py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl hover:bg-primary-700 active:scale-95 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 group/btn'])[1]
    Element Should Be Visible    (//button[@title='Edit'])[1]
    Element Should Be Visible    (//button[@title='Hapus'])[1]
    Sleep    1s
Fungsi pagination berjalan dengan baik
    Wait Until Element Is Visible    (//nav[@aria-label='Pagination'])[1]
    Scroll Element Into View    (//nav[@aria-label='Pagination'])[1]
    Sleep    1s
    Click Element    (//button[@class='px-3 py-2 text-sm bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-md hover:bg-slate-50 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed flex items-center md:px-4'])[2]
    Sleep    1s
    Click Element    (//button[@class='px-3 py-2 text-sm bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-md hover:bg-slate-50 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed flex items-center md:px-4'])[1]
    Sleep    1s
    Capture Page Screenshot   Embed
    Sleep    1s